WEBVTT

01:27.140 --> 01:29.980
<b>AQUARION</b>

01:30.340 --> 01:31.350
I, like,

01:31.690 --> 01:33.820
decided, Momohime-senpai,

01:33.820 --> 01:35.700
to kill you, 'kay?

01:35.920 --> 01:36.710
Huh?

01:38.030 --> 01:40.770
Just so you know. See ya later.

01:41.930 --> 01:43.500
Bye-bye!

01:44.680 --> 01:46.660
How can you say "bye-bye" to that?

01:47.890 --> 01:49.060
Who's that?

01:49.060 --> 01:50.880
My little sister's little sister.

01:54.260 --> 01:57.570
Element class is next,
 so you'd better go get changed.

01:57.570 --> 01:59.050
Okay.

02:07.410 --> 02:08.010
Jeez.

02:08.670 --> 02:12.010
Hana-chan, you're gonna be late to class.

02:12.850 --> 02:14.170
'Kay.

02:14.170 --> 02:18.370
Ichiki Hana tried to kill 
her sister Sayo many times.

02:18.700 --> 02:21.820
Sayo was able to dodge most of the attacks,

02:21.820 --> 02:25.200
but she was still hospitalized 
with serious injuries five times.

02:25.200 --> 02:28.840
Why would Hana-chan do that to Sayo?

02:28.840 --> 02:30.540
It's an expression of love.

02:30.540 --> 02:31.290
Huh?

02:31.290 --> 02:35.290
For her at least, love and hate 
are two sides of the same coin.

02:35.290 --> 02:39.860
For some reason, the feelings she would 
experience for someone she hates

02:39.860 --> 02:41.730
get turned toward the 
people she loves instead.

02:40.870 --> 02:42.750
On guard!

02:43.300 --> 02:47.440
Apparently, the Ichiki family couldn't 
even own any pets due to Hana's behavior.

02:47.440 --> 02:49.610
When Sayo came to the Academy,

02:49.610 --> 02:52.950
Hana was also assessed as 
well-suited to be an Element.

02:53.340 --> 02:57.180
The Academy said they would 
allow both girls to enroll,

02:57.180 --> 03:00.310
but their parents thought it would 
be best to keep the girls apart.

03:01.350 --> 03:07.060
When her sister left home, Hana no longer 
had an outlet for her behavior.

03:07.060 --> 03:09.240
She withdrew and stayed locked 
alone in her bedroom.

03:09.240 --> 03:10.110
Huh?

03:10.360 --> 03:15.240
For that reason, we've had a private tutor 
taking care of her all this time.

03:15.240 --> 03:17.810
When we reached out to the family again,

03:17.810 --> 03:20.130
they agreed to send Hana 
without a second thought.

03:20.410 --> 03:23.640
Basically, when Sayo died, 
her sister was next in line?

03:26.960 --> 03:28.180
That's right.

03:34.020 --> 03:35.430
What's she doing?

03:36.130 --> 03:39.070
I think she's taken a liking to me.

03:39.070 --> 03:40.040
Huh?

03:43.370 --> 03:47.460
Wanting to kill someone you 
love doesn't make any sense.

03:47.460 --> 03:50.970
Other people's emotions 
never make any sense.

03:50.970 --> 03:53.260
Well, especially for me.

03:53.860 --> 03:58.050
None of that stuff about school 
or Sayo's parents feels right.

03:58.650 --> 03:59.860
What do you mean?

04:00.740 --> 04:01.980
I don't know!

04:05.080 --> 04:09.520
I guess Momohime-senpai and 
Sun-kun really have started dating.

04:09.520 --> 04:10.390
Sun-kun?

04:10.390 --> 04:12.100
That's what everyone's been calling him.

04:12.100 --> 04:12.900
What's his family name?

04:12.900 --> 04:14.030
They say he doesn't have one.

04:14.030 --> 04:15.180
That can't be right.

04:15.180 --> 04:17.190
Some countries are like that, though.

04:17.880 --> 04:20.800
I don't know. It definitely pisses me off,

04:20.800 --> 04:23.280
but I also kinda think 
they make a good couple.

04:23.510 --> 04:24.480
Huh?!

04:25.390 --> 04:28.400
W-Well, it's her choice to make, anyway.

04:30.600 --> 04:32.570
What's that all about?

04:33.360 --> 04:34.780
That!

04:42.250 --> 04:44.550
What are we even doing here?

04:44.550 --> 04:48.640
I'm following because I'm curious 
about them. You, Sakko?

04:49.240 --> 04:50.670
I don't really...

04:51.080 --> 04:54.010
I mean, we can't leave her alone, right?

04:54.010 --> 04:56.060
Sounds like you're really curious, too.

04:56.060 --> 05:01.850
In the beginning, the two fell to 
the desert as small drops of water.

05:02.280 --> 05:06.510
Their feelings for one another turned 
into waves, ebbing and flowing,

05:07.120 --> 05:09.650
until they eventually became one form.

05:10.140 --> 05:12.450
That was the beginning of the universe.

05:13.170 --> 05:15.670
A tale from inside an egg.

05:16.640 --> 05:18.370
What could they be talking about?

05:18.800 --> 05:20.380
Makes you wonder, right?

05:20.950 --> 05:22.880
Yeah, I'm going home.

05:26.460 --> 05:27.560
Oh!

05:29.520 --> 05:31.090
Guys...

05:31.660 --> 05:34.100
You should go on home.

05:34.480 --> 05:35.640
All right.

05:38.590 --> 05:40.510
She's tame as a kitten now?

05:43.270 --> 05:46.570
Listen, man. What's your deal, 
asking Momohime out and stuff?

05:46.880 --> 05:49.680
Just so you know, if you're only 
trying to hook up with her,

05:49.680 --> 05:51.220
I'll make you regret it.

05:54.160 --> 05:57.170
Why do you guys kill Mythic Beasts

05:57.170 --> 05:59.050
when you don't even love them?

06:00.500 --> 06:03.080
You know about the Mythic Beasts?

06:04.150 --> 06:06.590
He is an Element candidate, after all.

06:06.590 --> 06:09.330
But why would we love those monsters?

06:11.580 --> 06:15.630
This cave is almost like a mother's womb.

06:15.630 --> 06:16.700
Huh?

06:17.020 --> 06:19.330
Do you understand this island's purpose?

06:20.110 --> 06:24.530
Do you know what they have 
been breeding you for?

06:24.810 --> 06:26.450
Breeding?

06:26.450 --> 06:27.800
Weird thing to say.

06:27.800 --> 06:30.530
They? Do you mean the teachers?

06:31.060 --> 06:34.390
This is a cradle for eggs 
that are waiting to hatch.

06:34.390 --> 06:36.160
They are simply waiting

06:37.250 --> 06:40.780
for the eggs to crack open and
 all of you to finally spring out.

06:41.550 --> 06:45.110
The Mythic Beasts are the 
bait to lure you out.

06:45.110 --> 06:48.430
I don't really get what you mean.

06:48.430 --> 06:50.960
I think I'm starting to.

06:52.080 --> 06:56.930
Yeah, but those things keep 
attacking us. We have to beat them!

06:58.210 --> 07:01.180
If that brings you pleasure, so be it.

07:02.510 --> 07:05.120
If it brings pain, it is unforgivable.

07:06.310 --> 07:09.850
Which is it for you?

07:20.710 --> 07:23.440
Hey, how long have we been in here?

07:24.790 --> 07:26.890
Wait... Already?

07:26.890 --> 07:28.250
About an hour.

07:28.250 --> 07:29.490
What?

07:30.750 --> 07:33.400
<i>What's changed since his arrival?</i>

07:33.680 --> 07:37.250
Nothing yet. There is no change 
in the students' mana levels

07:37.250 --> 07:39.970
and we have not observed any 
reaction-diffusion waves.

07:39.970 --> 07:43.330
<i>Do you have any proof that 
he is the real thing?</i>

07:44.020 --> 07:46.650
That has already been confirmed by DEAVA.

07:47.120 --> 07:52.240
Having more of the awakened around is exactly
 what the guys in the Egg Council want, too.

07:52.920 --> 07:57.250
<i>Is that why they decided 
to lend him to you now?</i>

07:57.790 --> 08:00.070
<i>With the union of universes approaching,</i>

08:00.070 --> 08:04.280
<i>they probably can't keep relying 
on their idealism alone.</i>

08:06.870 --> 08:10.870
Let's look at the stars together and 
have a conversation about the universe.

08:11.190 --> 08:14.010
Let's have a conversation 
about the universe.

08:16.350 --> 08:17.690
Oh!

08:17.690 --> 08:19.900
What's this about?

08:21.950 --> 08:23.490
Is this for real?

08:26.120 --> 08:26.980
Huh?

08:26.980 --> 08:28.370
What's wrong?

08:28.370 --> 08:30.390
Doesn't it seem kinda empty today?

08:30.390 --> 08:31.340
You think so?

08:31.980 --> 08:34.750
Momohime! There was an announcement.

08:34.750 --> 08:35.520
Huh?

08:35.520 --> 08:39.030
About the new Element! 
It's that transfer student.

08:43.500 --> 08:48.510
That's how Ichiki Sayo's death was rewritten 
by the universe's ability to self-correct.

08:48.510 --> 08:50.590
This is the truth as we know it.

08:51.230 --> 08:52.510
Is that right?

08:53.290 --> 08:55.860
So what now?

08:57.500 --> 09:00.050
Are you going to force 
Hana-chan to pilot a unit?

09:00.050 --> 09:03.520
I told you that Ichiki-san, like her sister, 
is well-suited to be an Element.

09:03.520 --> 09:07.030
But I know Sayo wouldn't want 
to put Hana-chan in danger!

09:07.030 --> 09:08.730
Do you think you're her guardian now?

09:08.730 --> 09:09.600
Huh?

09:09.600 --> 09:12.320
It isn't your decision. It's Ichiki-san's.

09:12.320 --> 09:12.760
But...

09:12.760 --> 09:15.570
Ichiki-san, I'll give you some time.

09:15.570 --> 09:18.280
Think it over carefully 
before making a decision.

09:19.580 --> 09:22.320
Hana-chan, you okay?

09:22.980 --> 09:26.750
You really loved your 
big sister, didn't you?

09:27.510 --> 09:31.880
So what are you gonna do 
about becoming an Element?

09:32.370 --> 09:37.610
Dunno for sure yet, 
but I might wanna try it.

09:37.610 --> 09:39.440
Don't, Hana-chan!

09:39.440 --> 09:43.260
When you're in Aquarion, 
you could die in battle!

09:43.890 --> 09:48.150
And I know Sayo wouldn't want that.

09:49.590 --> 09:52.710
I made a promise to my sis.

09:53.060 --> 09:54.140
Huh?

09:55.100 --> 10:01.520
Hey, Sis, I'm sorry. 
I really, really like you a lot.

10:01.520 --> 10:03.840
So... I like you, so...

10:03.840 --> 10:08.130
I know. I like you a lot too, Hana.

10:08.130 --> 10:09.370
Really?

10:09.370 --> 10:10.120
Yeah.

10:11.770 --> 10:15.470
I like you more than anyone else
in the whole wide world, Sis.

10:15.470 --> 10:18.170
Yeah. Okay.

10:18.170 --> 10:22.100
Then can you promise me you'll only 
kill the person you like the most?

10:22.100 --> 10:23.830
The one I like most?

10:23.830 --> 10:26.950
Yeah. You like me the most, right, Hana?

10:26.950 --> 10:28.430
Yeah, I do!

10:28.430 --> 10:30.880
More than anyone else in the world?

10:30.880 --> 10:32.540
In the universe!

10:33.770 --> 10:35.510
Then promise me this.

10:35.510 --> 10:41.360
I'll let you kill me someday, 
but until then, you can't kill anyone else.

10:41.730 --> 10:47.250
Yeah. Okay, it's a deal. 
I'll kill the person I like most.

10:47.250 --> 10:49.950
Until then, I won't kill anybody else.

10:50.800 --> 10:55.790
It's all right. You're a strong girl, Hana.
 I know you are.

10:56.750 --> 11:00.090
But then Sis died.

11:00.090 --> 11:04.430
The person I like the most left me.

11:06.190 --> 11:10.300
Hana-chan, have you ever 
hated anyone before?

11:10.770 --> 11:12.280
Hate?

11:12.830 --> 11:15.450
I don't really know what hate means.

11:16.050 --> 11:17.380
I knew it.

11:17.900 --> 11:23.370
Listen, Hana-chan, I think you can't hate 
people because you don't have that emotion.

11:23.620 --> 11:25.640
Hate, huh?

11:25.990 --> 11:32.830
So that's why when you like something a 
whole lot, you start wanting to kill it instead.

11:32.830 --> 11:34.770
Is this what Munakata-sensei meant

11:34.770 --> 11:38.320
when she said that love and hate 
were two sides of the same coin?

11:38.320 --> 11:41.750
When that balance is upset and you have 
feelings of affection for someone,

11:41.750 --> 11:46.010
you treat the one you love like 
someone you hate instead.

11:46.350 --> 11:51.280
I got it. I'll take Sayo's place.

11:51.680 --> 11:55.400
But in exchange, you aren't 
allowed to kill anybody but me.

11:55.690 --> 11:58.150
Momohime-senpai, I love you!

12:06.640 --> 12:10.250
Are those two okay? 
Is it safe to leave them alone?

12:10.250 --> 12:14.200
As long as she's careful, I don't 
think she'll get caught off guard.

12:14.200 --> 12:18.090
You might be right. Now what about 
the other kid in the Element class?

12:18.400 --> 12:22.360
It makes you wonder, doesn't it? 
The stuff he said before.

12:22.360 --> 12:22.890
Huh?

12:22.890 --> 12:26.780
You know. If it brings us 
pleasure and all that.

12:26.780 --> 12:30.220
Oh. The reason we fight, right?

12:33.970 --> 12:35.090
My bad.

12:54.670 --> 12:56.080
Shall we go?

12:56.080 --> 12:57.180
Yes.

12:58.950 --> 13:02.760
'Kay. Time to go an' try to 
kill Momohime-senpai again.

13:09.300 --> 13:12.300
Hm? Sakko-senpai?

13:13.790 --> 13:14.980
Oh.

13:21.140 --> 13:23.680
What did you wanna talk about?

13:23.680 --> 13:27.080
About the promise 
 you made with Sayo yesterday.

13:27.590 --> 13:29.810
That doesn't give you a 
reason to fight, does it?

13:30.710 --> 13:35.340
Momohime would... well, I think we'd 
all do whatever we can to protect you.

13:35.340 --> 13:37.680
We'd risk our lives to save you, Hana.

13:38.620 --> 13:40.590
Are you okay with that?

13:40.590 --> 13:41.750
Get it...

13:41.750 --> 13:42.600
Huh?

13:42.600 --> 13:46.180
I mean, I actually do get it, in my head,

13:46.180 --> 13:49.630
that I can't really kill 
Momohime-senpai or anything.

13:50.260 --> 13:52.230
But I can't control my feelings.

13:52.650 --> 13:55.630
I like her so much, 
it makes me wanna kill her.

13:56.030 --> 13:57.060
But...

13:57.060 --> 13:57.960
But?

13:58.340 --> 14:02.780
The second I tangle with Momohime-senpai and am about to kill her,

14:02.780 --> 14:04.030
I can forget all that.

14:04.580 --> 14:08.500
So maybe if we can be in Aquarion together,

14:08.500 --> 14:11.280
it'll make me stop wanting to kill her.

14:12.930 --> 14:19.880
The egg split into two. One half became 
silver and the other half became gold.

14:20.390 --> 14:23.210
The universe of silver was 
overwhelmed by tears.

14:23.210 --> 14:25.840
The universe of gold was 
enveloped in flames.

14:26.310 --> 14:32.080
The things contained inside became 
emotions that are still connected today.

14:32.080 --> 14:33.720
Emotions?

14:33.720 --> 14:36.680
That is what mana is.

14:37.760 --> 14:38.760
Mana?

14:41.280 --> 14:44.540
Sayo said something just before she died.

14:44.540 --> 14:45.350
Huh?

14:46.500 --> 14:48.270
That she didn't want to die.

14:50.140 --> 14:53.390
She never knew what it 
meant to love herself,

14:53.390 --> 14:55.850
but she figured it out 
at the very last second.

14:56.690 --> 14:57.860
Sis...

14:58.450 --> 15:01.610
Maybe it doesn't only happen 
right before death.

15:01.610 --> 15:06.760
When we're united, I think I understand 
better what it means to feel afraid.

15:06.760 --> 15:08.120
Does that mean...

15:09.730 --> 15:12.140
I wasn't sure if I should say this,

15:12.140 --> 15:17.100
but I'm really happy that 
I got to unite with Sayo.

15:21.210 --> 15:25.310
Sakko-senpai, I've made up my mind.

15:25.310 --> 15:28.700
So have I. I feel better now. Thanks a lot.

15:28.700 --> 15:30.090
My pleasure.

15:32.020 --> 15:33.420
Sakko-senpai,

15:34.120 --> 15:37.960
I think I like you so much, 
I almost wanna kill ya.

15:41.800 --> 15:44.310
Is that supposed to make me happy?

15:47.870 --> 15:49.090
Sensei.

15:50.050 --> 15:51.820
I've made up my mind.

15:52.570 --> 15:53.500
I see.

15:54.910 --> 15:55.950
What is it?

15:57.090 --> 15:58.100
I've got your answer.

15:58.100 --> 16:01.710
About the reason I fight.

16:01.710 --> 16:03.770
It's because I feel more 
whole when I'm with them.

16:04.320 --> 16:05.820
For a little while, anyway.

16:07.620 --> 16:12.620
When I unite with them, it feels like 
I've found something I'm missing.

16:30.400 --> 16:31.500
Momo-nee...

16:31.830 --> 16:32.980
Hm?

16:31.830 --> 16:32.980
Oh.

16:33.780 --> 16:35.380
Momohime-senpai!

16:40.220 --> 16:41.260
Momo-nee!

16:41.680 --> 16:42.910
Momohime-senpai!

16:43.350 --> 16:44.810
Hey! Momohime!

16:59.810 --> 17:03.840
It's location is Yugawara. It's within the 
last stake's 15-kilometer range.

17:03.840 --> 17:07.730
This is bad! Hold it off with drones 
until the Elements can launch!

17:07.730 --> 17:11.090
It has a form similar to the last one, 
but it is a different creature.

17:11.090 --> 17:16.020
Meaning that even if we defeat it, 
the stake from the last time won't disappear?

17:16.020 --> 17:18.600
<i>Everyone, a Mythic Beast has appeared.</i>

17:18.600 --> 17:21.260
<i>Ichiki-san is on standby. 
All of you, come quickly!</i>

17:21.260 --> 17:24.970
You go. I'll take Momohime-senpai 
to the infirmary.

17:24.970 --> 17:25.910
Yeah, but...

17:25.910 --> 17:28.320
It's okay. Let's go, Sakko.

17:28.320 --> 17:29.070
Toshi...

17:29.280 --> 17:32.710
If we don't go now, more people might die!

17:33.250 --> 17:35.960
Fine. Take care of her, Rimiya.

17:35.960 --> 17:36.660
Mm-hmm.

17:46.260 --> 17:48.710
Haven't the Elements launched yet?

17:48.710 --> 17:50.390
They have arrived. Launch now!

17:50.390 --> 17:51.420
Roger.

17:51.630 --> 17:54.000
All Vector Machine units, launch!

17:54.870 --> 17:58.270
<i>Like the last Mythic Beast, this one is 
armed with swirling, flexible weapons.</i>

17:58.270 --> 18:01.190
The head will be Tir. Hatano Toshi-kun.

18:01.460 --> 18:03.480
All right. I'll do it.

18:04.650 --> 18:07.660
Mythic Star Union! Go, Aquarion!

18:19.050 --> 18:22.140
Oh. So this is a union?

18:22.640 --> 18:25.420
Th-This is sick!

18:26.160 --> 18:28.140
<i>Aquarion Tir!</i>

18:46.980 --> 18:49.820
<i>We were able to grab the last one!</i>

19:20.980 --> 19:23.050
I will kill you now.

19:28.220 --> 19:29.330
<i>No, you won't!</i>

19:33.890 --> 19:35.390
<i>Don't let it place the stake!</i>

19:35.390 --> 19:36.360
All right!

19:44.380 --> 19:45.850
<i>We have to get it now!</i>

19:49.950 --> 19:55.450
Wh-What is this? 
Did Momohime-senpai pass out?

19:55.450 --> 19:56.790
Momohime-senpai!

20:02.260 --> 20:03.270
Hana-chan?!

20:04.160 --> 20:07.730
What's wrong? Ichiki-san's mana 
gauge has become unstable!

20:13.320 --> 20:14.060
Hana!

20:14.060 --> 20:15.190
Hana-chan!

20:15.190 --> 20:16.400
<i>It's Vector Feoh.</i>

20:23.830 --> 20:25.030
Hana-chan!

20:25.030 --> 20:25.820
Hana!

20:27.820 --> 20:29.770
It's headed for the city!

20:33.280 --> 20:34.700
Snap out of it!

20:36.920 --> 20:41.310
It's all right. You're a strong girl, Hana. 
I know you are.

20:42.860 --> 20:45.900
Sis, Momohime-senpai...

20:46.480 --> 20:49.690
Aren't you fighting for 
Sayo and Momohime's sake?

20:49.950 --> 20:51.450
I want to protect them, too.

20:51.800 --> 20:54.260
So lend me your strength!

21:00.990 --> 21:04.030
You'll be fine, Hana. You can do this!

21:04.030 --> 21:05.410
Hana-chan!

21:05.410 --> 21:08.580
Toshi-senpai. Sakko-senpai.

21:08.940 --> 21:09.790
All right!

21:10.440 --> 21:12.490
Now's your chance! Unite!

21:12.750 --> 21:14.180
Roger!

21:14.180 --> 21:17.580
Mythic Star Union! Go, Aquarion!

21:27.350 --> 21:31.020
It's so hot. Is this from Hana-chan?

21:31.020 --> 21:31.830
Yeah.

21:32.210 --> 21:34.600
I feel it, too. Hana!

21:37.410 --> 21:38.890
This must be...

21:39.430 --> 21:43.240
Aquarion Siegel's red flame!

21:43.240 --> 21:48.060
Aquarion! Sun Attack Love Hug!

21:50.620 --> 21:53.000
<b>Transcendent Love Hug Attack</b>
